{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49383","headline":"柳含烟 三 · 毛文锡","name":"柳含烟 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"章台柳，近垂旒。\n低拂往来冠盖，朦胧春色满皇州。\n瑞烟浮。\n直与路边江畔别，免被离人攀折。\n最怜京兆画蛾眉，叶纤时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}